  We recommend creating a binding to ImageMagick as an image filter. See [http://www.imagemagick.org/script/archi ... hp#filters](http://www.imagemagick.org/script/architecture.php#filters). Image filters are staging areas for experimental code. With an image filter, users can test the quantization algorithm and provide feedback. Once the bugs are resolved and there is a degree of stability and user acceptance, we will consider including it in the main ImageMagick distribution.
  
