  | ![](https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif) |  | [crazygringo](https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=crazygringo) [on June 27, 2012](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=4168638) \| [parent](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=4167964#4168259) \| [next](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=4167964#4168397)\[–\]<br>Woah! How is it 2012, and only _now_ I discover that there exist PNG files where transparency works in IE6 ???<br>What the hell?<br>I mean, this would have actually been _really_ useful for me... like, five years ago. | |
